; Id: raa-destination-host-absent
; AVP: Destination-Host
; Command: Re-Auth-Answer
; Section: 6.5
"This AVP MUST be present in all unsolicited agent initiated messages, MAY be present in request messages, and MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: asa-destination-host-absent
; AVP: Destination-Host
; Command: Abort-Session-Answer
; Section: 6.5
"This AVP MUST be present in all unsolicited agent initiated messages, MAY be present in request messages, and MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: sta-destination-host-absent
; AVP: Destination-Host
; Command: Session-Termination-Answer
; Section: 6.5
"This AVP MUST be present in all unsolicited agent initiated messages, MAY be present in request messages, and MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: aca-destination-host-absent
; AVP: Destination-Host
; Command: Accounting-Answer
; Section: 6.5
"This AVP MUST be present in all unsolicited agent initiated messages, MAY be present in request messages, and MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: cea-destination-realm-absent
; AVP: Destination-Realm
; Command: Capabilities-Exchange-Answer
; Section: 6.6
"The Destination-Realm AVP MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: dpa-destination-realm-absent
; AVP: Destination-Realm
; Command: Disconnect-Peer-Answer
; Section: 6.6
"The Destination-Realm AVP MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: dwa-destination-realm-absent
; AVP: Destination-Realm
; Command: Device-Watchdog-Answer
; Section: 6.6
"The Destination-Realm AVP MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: raa-destination-realm-absent
; AVP: Destination-Realm
; Command: Re-Auth-Answer
; Section: 6.6
"The Destination-Realm AVP MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: asa-destination-realm-absent
; AVP: Destination-Realm
; Command: Abort-Session-Answer
; Section: 6.6
"The Destination-Realm AVP MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: sta-destination-realm-absent
; AVP: Destination-Realm
; Command: Session-Termination-Answer
; Section: 6.6
"The Destination-Realm AVP MUST NOT be present in answer messages."
